OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FRain clears from many central
OL,6,Fand southern areas, with a few showers
OL,7,Ffollowing. Rain persists across
OL,8,Fnorthern England and eastern Scotland,
OL,9,Fwhile persistent showers spread into
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland and Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
